Question raised by AAS 
===============================================================
The origin of the data used in this work must be clearly specified. 
Although three previous papers are cited, none appear to provide publicly available simulation snapshots. 
If the analysis relies on snapshots from a specific existing simulation, this should be stated explicitly, together with a concise description of the simulation setup and methodology. 
Alternatively, if the simulations were newly generated for this study following the methods outlined in the cited works, this should be clearly indicated and accompanied by a substantially more detailed description of the simulation procedure than is currently provided.
