Correspondence with Dr. Besla regarding citation of data points
===============================================================
I am seeking clarification on whether I may use the Milky Way–Andromeda (MW–M31) merger simulation snapshots that were provided for the ASTR 400B course to demonstrate and generate plots for an analysis pipeline I have since substantially extended. 
I plan to publish the methodology developed for this pipeline, which focuses on the analysis of halo shapes, as a research note for the American Astronomical Society (AAS). 
Because the simulation data set does not appear to be publicly available, I would also appreciate guidance on whether its use is permitted for this purpose and how it should be properly cited in a publication.
